// a causal TCN over the mel column: 40 -> 48 (k3), 5 x 48 -> 48 (k3, dilations 1 2 4 8 16, residual, ReLU), receptive field 65 hops; two heads on the shared 32-wide hidden column: the voice logit -> sigmoid, and the 61-way pitch
